'''Catman''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] and [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]] grants [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]] and targets [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies instead of [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]]. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]] increases health, shortens recharge and attack cycle, and gains [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] Target and [[Immune to Drain|Drain Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]].

