==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Catman was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Just Us League (Removed Combo)|Just Us League]] and [[Revengers (Removed Combo)|Revengers]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], Catman's English description mispelled paparazzi as pa'''pp'''arazzi.
*Catman's name and all of his forms, especially his Evolved Form, reference the DC superhero [[wikipedia:Batman|Batman]].
**The Japanese names of Ultimate Catman (Catman Rising) and Catman Forever's name in every version reference the Batman movies ''[[wikipedia:The Dark Knight Rises|The Dark Knight Rises]]'' and ''[[wikipedia:Batman Forever|Batman Forever]]'', respectively.
*Ultimate Catman was the first [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] to have Immune to Curse and the first to evolve with Elder [[Catfruit]].
*Along with [[Saber the Cat (Special Cat)|Saber Alter Cat]], they are the very first units with Drain Immunity.

